      "\u001b[0;31mDocstring:\u001b[0m\n",
      "Compute estimate of the effective sample size (ess).\n",
      "\n",
      "Parameters\n",
      "----------\n",
      "input_array:\n",
      "    An array representing multiple chains of MCMC samples. The array must\n",
